# W882 (nemik:W224): a citation's repo part is a path of segments. Each segment must lead with a
# letter or digit, so `..` and a hidden directory cannot be cited; a segment that is empty or dot-led
# is refused by name before any read; a link anywhere on the way is refused as data.
